# q (kdb+): Q for Mortals and the kdb+ reference (code.kx.com); requirements/languages/q.md
name     q kdb
keyword  select exec update delete from where by if do while
builtin  count sum avg min max first last til each over scan til show string type enlist distinct
builtin  asc desc xasc xdesc lj ij aj cols meta
line-comment   /
string   " "  : escapes
sigil    `    : attr
sigil    .    : meta
operators  +-*%&|^!<>=:#$@,_~?'
